{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_120_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_120","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_120_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_120","textTraditional":"六年春，晉趙盾、衛孫免侵陳。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_120_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_120","textTraditional":"夏四月。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_120_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_120","textTraditional":"秋八月，螽。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_120_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_120","textTraditional":"冬十月。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_120_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_120","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_120_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_120","textTraditional":"六年春，晉、衛侵陳，陳即楚故也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_120_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_120","textTraditional":"夏，定王使子服求后于齊。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_120_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_120","textTraditional":"秋，赤狄伐晉。圍懷及邢丘。晉侯欲伐之，中行桓子曰：「使疾其民，以盈其貫，將可殪也。《周書》曰：『殪戎殷。』此類之謂也。」","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_120_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_120","textTraditional":"冬，召桓公逆王后于齊。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_120_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_120","textTraditional":"楚人伐鄭，取成而還。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_120_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_120","textTraditional":"鄭公子曼滿與王子伯廖語，欲為卿。伯廖告人曰：「無德而貪，其在《周易》豐之離，弗過之矣。」間一歲，鄭人殺之。","sentenceOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}